{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": [
    "Curated local-inference model catalog for aphrody.",
    "Every entry was resolved against the Hugging Face API on 2026-08-21: the",
    "revision is pinned to the repository commit that was current then, and the",
    "byte size / SHA-256 come from that commit's LFS pointers. Sidecar files",
    "(tokenizer, config, yml) are not LFS objects, so they carry a size but no digest.",
    "Pinning to a commit rather than a branch is what makes the digests stable:",
    "`main` can move, a commit cannot.",
    "`accel` lists the execution providers a backend can run this entry on;",
    "`vram_min_bytes` is what the weights need resident (0 = comfortable on CPU);",
    "`speed` ranks throughput within a task: fast > balanced > quality."
  ],
  "entries": [
